# Scacelith - Português (Brasil)
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other (0 and 1 are
# singular). Brazilian usage (tela, arquivo, baixar, senha); terms follow the pt-BR glossary.
# Register: the user is "você" (mostly implicit); buttons and menu commands in the infinitive
# ("Salvar", "Abandonar"); sentence case for labels; titles in capitals as in English.
# The player's gender is unknown: no adjective or participle agrees with the player ("Sessão
# iniciada como {0}", "Você saiu", "Agora não" rather than "Conectado como", "Não, obrigado").
# Sides: "as Brancas" / "as Pretas" (feminine plural); viewer.side.* carry no article, the
# sentences around them do. Chess terms: lance, xeque, afogamento, roque, rating, planilha.

